      "Address 0100 A2 A1 A0: 0x20-0x27 (NXP and TI PCF8574A: 0111 A2 A1 A0, 0x38-0x3F; same pins). A2-A0 straight to VCC or GND.",
      "The ports are quasi-bidirectional: write 1 to read a pin as input; a high output is only a weak current source (about 100 uA), so drive LEDs and loads low-side (sinking up to 25 mA)."
